# Grok every time (Builder + Audit)

Map paint proved we ship spaghetti without external review. **grok_search runs on every session that touches code** — not only when Audit asks.

## Hard gate — no ship without Grok

Before editing lua or bumping version:

1. Read game logs from disk (if bug/repro exists)
2. **grok_search** — at least one query (MCP: `user-grok` → `grok_search`)
3. Grep reference mods in `OTHERMODS/` (ModTemplate, ferrystones, teleportsmanager, enemy_nameplates, ORIGINAL QUEST TRACKER for map)
4. Implement only after **MATCH CHECK** — Grok vs ours vs merge
5. Ship handoff must cite Grok sources (URLs) or mark **unverified** and do not ship API guesses

Skipping Grok on "small fix" or "same pattern" is **banned** for Quest Tracker until map pins + window are stable.

## When to query (always pick ≥1)

- Any change to `quest_tracker_map.lua` (paint, pins, hooks, labels)
- Any ImGui/window/layout change
- Any new SDK hook or singleton call
- Refactor / dedupe / "can we do it better" / spaghetti pass
- User says run grok (immediate)

## Query shape

One focused query. Name exact SDK types/methods from our code. Ask for: full Lua + pcall, call order, DD2 2026 compat. Request source URLs.

Example:
```
DD2 REFramework [feature]: app.Type.method, fields. Show full Lua pcall.
Order: A then B then C? Compare gibbed almanac / Original Quest Tracker. Sources required.
```

## After Grok — required in ship reply

```
## GROK
- Query: ...
- Sources: (min 2 URLs)
- Recommendation: ...

## MATCH CHECK
| Reference | Match? | Notes |

## VERDICT
| Item | Grok | Ours | Merge |
```

## Spaghetti pass (same session as Grok)

On every touch of `quest_tracker_map.lua`, `quest_tracker_window.lua`, or `quest_tracker.lua`:

- Flag duplicate code paths (two functions doing same paint/draw)
- Flag inverted call order between hook vs refresh
- Flag file >900 lines without extract plan
- Prefer one canonical function over second special-case branch

## MegaLens

Grok first ($0). MegaLens L3 only if Grok + static + user test still FAIL and user approves ~$0.22.

## Voice

If tempted to skip: "Grok skipped" is not allowed for QT ships. Run it.
